{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/28/7060741/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遂に地方公演が終了しました〜〜！！！\n大きな怪我もなく\n全員で無事に乗り切れて\n良かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだセットリストとかは書けないので\n軽い(食)レポと感想をお届けします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/28/7060741/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初っ端という事でとても緊張しました！\nこの日は旅行がてらに祖父母と母も\n東京から仙台に呼んだので\n余計にいろんな汗をかきました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しは孝行出来たみたいで良かった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台といえば牛タンが美味しいのは\nもちろんのこと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずんだが美味しすぎる問題で\nずんだばかり食べてました。\nずんだ！ずんだ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/28/7060741/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく暑くて\n開始10分くらいで滝汗！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段こんなに汗かかないんだけど(ﾟДﾟ)？！\nって驚くくらいの滝汗。\nでもみんなの熱気もあっての\n滝汗なので満足"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋はやっぱりきしめんと味噌カツ。\nあと手羽先もかあ〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日の胃袋はブラックホールで\nどんなに食べても苦しくなかった(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/28/7060741/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は今まで一度も来たことが\nなかったんです。\nはじめまして、広島県さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どでかいバームクーヘンが\nあったから冷凍してちまちま食べたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと生もみじ饅頭の美味しさに\nびっくり仰天！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんとまあやの地元ということで\nいろんな場面で泣きそうになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、しゃもじ(のお菓子)\n買ったよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/28/7060741/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/28/7060741/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"博多の豚骨らーめんが好きすぎて\n食べ過ぎました。\nお腹パンパンで苦しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懲りずに2日目は、\n高菜と明太子を入れると\n当たり前に美味しいという事に\n気付き、更にパンパンでした。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡の方言可愛いくて好き！\nライブ中たくさん使えた気がする！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/28/7060741/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/28/7060741/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"粉ものがあまり好きではないのですが、\nイカ焼きというものに出会い\n粉ものの見方が180度変わり\n大好きになりました。\n粉もの is wonderful。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとフルーツ大福！美味しすぎ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果食べ過ぎパンパン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方最終公演ということもあって\n凄く盛り上がって嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また絶対に帰ってきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に楽しくて美味しくて\nあっという間に8月が\n過ぎ去ろうとしています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残すは神宮球場！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨年よりも一回りも二回りも\n成長した私たちを見に来てくださいね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【お知らせ】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8/31 25:29〜 日本テレビ\nNOGIBINGO5！\n自前の浴衣で出演しています(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/28/7060741/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9/2 24:00〜 bayFM\nまいちゅんカフェ\n今週も飛鳥が来店してくれてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/28/7060741/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という事で、\n今日はこの辺でおしまいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/08/28/7060741/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏が終わってしまう、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書きます！"}],"source":"archive"}